      "created_at": "2025-05-20T15:59:50Z",
      "updated_at": "2025-05-20T15:59:50Z",
      "body": "Just wanted to chime in here: Our project relies on `#text` always being present. We ran into this same bug where `#text` is missing for self-closing elements that have attributes. We're not asking for the same feature the OP is asking for, but would love for that bug to be fixed.",
